# Todo

Roadmap of upcoming work. The detailed working backlog lives in `.agents/TODO.md`.

## Planned

* Packaging: Flatpak, Snap and Deb builds
* Guard against over-large circuits (warn before a load/save/simulation hangs)
* Auto-scroll the timing diagram to follow the latest timestamp while running
* Playback polish: frame subsampling for very long timelines, optional per-session speed

## Done

* Animated logic-circuit playback with a floating transport bar
* Themed component icon set (all components, ANSI + IEC variants)
